sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Discord
  participant Bot as zc-discord
  participant API as ZeepCentraal server
  participant DB as Database services
  User->>Discord: Slash command or component
  Discord->>Bot: Interaction event
  Bot->>Bot: Check command and permission
  Bot->>API: Fetch or mutate requested data
  API->>DB: Read or persist state
  DB-->>API: Result
  API-->>Bot: Backend response
  Bot-->>Discord: Interaction response
  Discord-->>User: Message or updated component
